# Openly licensed PDFs (corpus/files/drive, corpus/files/web) live in the repo for the public
# corpus, not in the app image (Justin, 2026-10-17). The corpus pack in corpus/rhetcomp/ still ships,
# and so do the corpus/files manifests: warm_content uses them to fetch each PDF from the repo
# (content/repo_pdfs.py) into the content cache on the Fly volume.
corpus/files/**/*.pdf
